              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='93617' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98912' x='544' y='5487'>
              <zone h='11310' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='98912' x='544' y='5487' />
              <zone h='82307' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='98912' x='544' y='16797'>
                <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                  <story-points>
                    <story-point caption='Overall Sales Growth Trend (2011–2022)' captured-sheet='Yearly Real Estate Sales Trend (2011–2022)' id='1' />
                    <story-point caption='Town-wise Performance &amp; Sales Ratio' captured-sheet='Average Sales Ratio by Town and Residential Type' id='2' />
                    <story-point caption='Property Type Composition' captured-sheet='Distribution of Property Types' id='3' />
                    <story-point caption='Key Insights &amp; Recommendations' captured-sheet='' id='5' />
                  </story-points>
                </flipboard>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='15321' id='6' story-point-id='1' type-v2='text' w='36212' x='9028' y='32969'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' underline='true'>Insight</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>
* Real estate sales increased significantly from 2011 onward.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>* Sales peaked in 2021, indicating strong market activity.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>* A decline in 2022 suggests market stabilization after rapid growth.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='16279' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='60844' x='4220' y='61149'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Key Insights</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Sales performance varies significantly across towns.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Some towns contribute a much larger share of total sales revenue.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Higher sales ratios indicate stronger property valuation and market demand.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='14637' hidden='true' id='11' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='65456' x='6281' y='81532'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' underline='true'>Key Insights</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>* Single Family properties account for the largest share of sales.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>* Condos and Apartments contribute a smaller proportion of market activity.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol' fontsize='9'>* Residential property demand is concentrated in family-oriented housing.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='19973' hidden='true' id='12' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='62218' x='3533' y='23256'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#9a4b56' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Key Findings</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Sales growth was strongest between 2011 and 2021.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Geographic location plays a major role in sales performance.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Single Family homes dominate the real estate market.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* High-value properties generate a significant portion of total revenue.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='30506' hidden='true' id='13' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='62414' x='4024' y='55814'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#9a4b56' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Recommendations</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Focus investment on high-performing towns.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Monitor emerging towns with improving sales ratios.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Prioritize high-demand residential property types.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#0d0d0d' fontname='-apple-system-body,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Apple Color Emoji,Arial,sans-serif,Segoe UI Emoji,Segoe UI Symbol'>* Continue tracking yearly sales trends for future forecasting.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{2A98D11C-DA14-49E4-BAE5-42A2803863B4}' />
